---
layout: base.njk
title: Quit Nursing
description: Notes on nursing, money, and financial independence.
showHero: true
---
<div class="page-columns">
  <div class="main-column">
    <div class="article-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <a class="article-row" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="article-thumb">
          {% if post.data.image %}<img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="">{% endif %}
        </span>
        <span class="article-body">
          <span class="article-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
          <span class="article-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          <span class="article-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt or (post.templateContent | excerpt(140)) }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {% else %}
      <p>First post is coming soon.</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="list-footer">more writing soon</p>
  </div>

  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-box">
      <span class="sidebar-label">About</span>
      <p class="sidebar-text">A nurse in her 40s, later to FIRE than most, figuring out the math for a work optional life.</p>
      <a href="/start-here/" class="sidebar-link">more about me &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-box sidebar-stats">
      <span class="sidebar-label">Years to go</span>
      <span class="stat-number">{{ site.yearsToGo }}</span>
      <div class="stat-divider"></div>
      <span class="sidebar-label">Shifts to work</span>
      <span class="stat-number">{{ site.shiftsToWork }}</span>
      <span class="stat-updated">updated {{ site.statsUpdated }}</span>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
